    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "By default, this configuration disables plane detection.",
      "ko": "Use this structure to access information about a sample from a [`CameraFrame`](cameraframe.md), such as the frame’s settings and parameters, a pixel buffer that contains the sample’s data, and so on.",
      "sourceHash": "909e4abf061f935b0dd5dd91040bcc2ac1ef5f4bde9097ef9511b229563d09a6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "If you enable horizontal or vertical plane detection, the session adds ARPlaneAnchor objects and notifies your ARSessionDelegate, ARSCNViewDelegate, or ARSKViewDelegate object when its analysis of captured video images detects an area that appears to be a flat surface.",
      "ko": "수평 또는 수직 평면 감지를 사용하도록 설정하면, 세션은 ARPlaneAnchor 객체를 추가하고 캡처한 비디오 이미지 분석에서 평면처럼 보이는 영역을 감지할 때 ARSessionDelegate, ARSCNViewDelegate 또는 ARSKViewDelegate 객체에 알립니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c2bcb792dcd50af91eebb9dafe98412a364ac34cfc58123b57b6b88c7637c262",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "Use an empty set literal `[]` to specify no plane detection.",
      "ko": "평면 감지를 사용하지 않으려면 빈 세트 리터럴 `[]`을 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "cd526ffe570e79f5c96521ddb06568e7b152f3e91fdc4eb9d95637b6ce43b679",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
